(Purpose) Tj T*
(This procedure defines how training records is carried out at Brookvale.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Scope) Tj T*
(Applies to all training records activities in production and quality control at Brookvale.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Responsibilities) Tj T*
(The process owner, Rosa Moreau, maintains this procedure. Quality approves it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Procedure) Tj T*
(Step 1: Confirm the logbook entry.) Tj T*
(Step 2: Clean the equipment status label.) Tj T*
(Step 3: Document deviations to Quality within one day.) Tj T*
(Step 4: Escalate the area is free of previous materials.) Tj T*
(Step 5: Verify the result against the acceptance criterion.) Tj T*
(Step 6: Record the second-person check.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Records) Tj T*
(Records of training records are kept for five years after batch expiry.) Tj T*
